  characterName: ' Siriya Bandara'
  promptText: "Friend, protest is now a crime here. I lead the demonstrations for
    our sacred groves, but if I am jailed my mother loses her care. \n\nDo I keep
    organising?"
  leftAnswer: Keep organising. The groves have no other voice
  rightAnswer: Step back. Your mother needs you free
